			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766500101,
					"content": "~♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500102,
					"content": "…這不是朋友多不多的問題，就算把整座希汐島的長翎䴉都叫來，也不夠能把那面「盈月之鏡」搬走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500103,
					"content": "況且就算把它搬走，裡面那一尊「月諭之像」也…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500104,
					"content": "！！！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500105,
					"content": "#…挖走？我想，恐怕{F#妳}{M#你}也無法輕易將那面鏡子搬走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500106,
					"content": "♪♪♪♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500107,
					"content": "#欸？{F#妳}{M#你}真的能把整座希汐島的長翎䴉都叫來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500108,
					"content": "…牠就算出動了整個家族也沒用…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500109,
					"content": "！！！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500110,
					"content": "嗚哇，這裡好熱鬧，怎麼有一隻盜寶鼬和一隻鳥吵起來了…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500111,
						766500112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500111,
					"content": "難道是合作犯案了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500113,
					"content": "準確來說，我們其實算是在「策劃犯案」，現在正在討論「犯案細節」呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500114,
					"content": "只不過，我的「共犯」們所想的方法，都有點太過直接了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500115,
					"content": "♪♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500116,
					"content": "好好，知道你朋友滿天下了。你到底是從哪裡學來這種語氣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500117,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500118,
					"content": "…那位戴著帽子的，矮矮的鐵手臂女孩一直這樣碎碎唸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500119,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500120,
					"content": "…如果你喜歡，就這樣說話也可以，但…和那位小姐相處的時候，也不必學那麼多，好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500121,
					"content": "#接下來我要跟{NICKNAME}和派蒙談正事，先安靜一點吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500122,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500123,
					"content": "這隻鳥真的安靜下來了…嗚哇，能聽懂動物說話真好呀，我也想要這種厲害的能力…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500124,
					"content": "…小派蒙，相信我，妳不會很喜歡這種能力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500125,
						766500126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500125,
					"content": "這、這種語氣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500127,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}誤會了。我的意思不是這種能力會招災引禍，或是讓人心神不寧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500128,
					"content": "但…其實也算是讓我心神不寧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500129,
					"content": "當我發現自己能夠聽懂動物說話時，一開始很高興，但之後我就發現有問題…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500130,
					"content": "這種能力，無時無刻都在生效，而且並不受我控制。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500131,
					"content": "欸…對喔，我都沒意識到這個問題，菈烏瑪能聽懂動物說話的能力是不受自己控制的，那也就是說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500132,
						766500133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500132,
					"content": "無論是在林間還是水邊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500134,
					"content": "…我之前曾經聽別人說過，在密林裡聽著鳥鳴，會感覺到林間特別幽靜，心情也會變好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500135,
					"content": "但是，無論去往何處，我都…沒有這種感覺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500136,
					"content": "待在林中時，我依然能聽見野貓、兔子、凜角鹿、帔髦獾、長翎䴉的談話聲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500137,
					"content": "牠們大聲討論著誰把誰的窩啄倒了、哪裡的樹枝品質最好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500138,
						766500139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500138,
					"content": "耳朵從未休息過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500140,
					"content": "好、好吧…我還是不要這樣的能力了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500141,
					"content": "早上被小鳥的叫聲叫醒的感覺還不錯，但是…如果是被亂七八糟的談話聲吵醒的話，我的心情一定不會很好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500142,
						766500143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500142,
					"content": "鳥叫聲也叫不醒妳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500144,
					"content": "如今…我倒是已經習慣了。要是哪天早晨沒有聽見團雀討論哪戶的水杯最適合洗澡，反而有點不習慣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500145,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500146,
					"content": "#…謝謝提醒，差點忘了正事。不過，既然{NICKNAME}在這裡，我們或許不用採取那麼…直接的方式了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500147,
						766500148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500147,
					"content": "我的朋友倒是也滿天下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500149
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500149,
					"content": "#不用，我只需要{F#妳}{M#你}一個人幫忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500150,
					"content": "#我相信，以{F#妳}{M#你}的聰慧，打開那道由先代「詠月使」藉由「盈月之鏡」製作的封閉保管室…應該只是舉手之勞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500151,
						766500152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500151,
					"content": "由先代「詠月使」製作的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500153
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500153,
					"content": "#放心吧，對{F#妳}{M#你}來說，一定不會很困難的。來，我們一起過去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500152,
					"content": "我要求現場教學！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500153
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500148,
					"content": "但可能要花點時間集合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500149
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500143,
					"content": "好幾次都是我把妳搖醒的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500139,
					"content": "無論到哪裡都很熱鬧呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500133,
					"content": "只要存在著動物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500126,
					"content": "這種氛圍…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500112,
					"content": "然後還談不攏分贓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500113
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7665002,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7665002
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
