			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766500201,
					"content": "#我們到了，{F#妳}{M#你}們所看到的，就是那面封存著「月諭之像」的「盈月之鏡」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500202,
					"content": "那尊雕像很珍貴嗎？居然用這麼大的陣仗上鎖…裡面不會有機關吧？就是只要一步踏錯，就會咻咻咻飛出箭來的那種。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500203,
						766500204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500203,
					"content": "我已經準備好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500205,
					"content": "放心，我已經提早叫這孩子去看過了，此處的封鎖中並無那類殺機。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500206,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500207,
					"content": "喔！是盜寶鼬喔，的確很值得信任。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500208,
						766500209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500208,
					"content": "但牠看起來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500210,
					"content": "呵呵，的確如此。每次拜託牠幫忙後，下次再請牠幫忙，我必須多付牠一枚摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500211,
					"content": "還會討價還價啊，不愧是「盜寶鼬」呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500212,
					"content": "不過，牠幫菈烏瑪守著那個「月諭之像」，是不是該換個名字了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500213,
					"content": "不如…叫「守寶鼬」好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500214,
					"content": "！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500215,
					"content": "嘿嘿，我可是會飛的，摸不到我啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500216,
					"content": "！！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500217,
						766500218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500217,
					"content": "別往我身上爬啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500219,
					"content": "好了，在客人面前別太失禮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500220,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500221,
						766500222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500221,
					"content": "所以，我要怎麼幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500223,
					"content": "唔，想取出那尊「月諭之像」，需要兩個人在不同的地方同時操作機關。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500224,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，請{F#妳}{M#你}們站到那片區域，負責操作那一側的機關。這一側則由我負責。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500225,
					"content": "可是，我們要怎麼樣才能同時…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500226
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500226,
					"content": "不必擔心，我在天上還有一雙眼睛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500227,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "長翎䴉"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500228,
					"content": "#牠會告訴我{F#妳}{M#你}的所在位置，還有眼前的機關模樣。放心，{F#妳}{M#你}只需要聽我的指示行動就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500222,
					"content": "要怎麼解開這個機關？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500223
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500218,
					"content": "至少別抓我頭髮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500209,
					"content": "一定不會白白幫忙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500204,
					"content": "我已經習慣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500205
					]
				}
			]
