			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 766500301,
					"content": "這尊「月諭之像」居然有這麼大…的確，無論是小鳥還是小鼬，都沒辦法把它弄出來呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500302,
					"content": "還被這麼大的一面鏡子鎖在裡面…菈烏瑪，這尊「月諭之像」很貴重嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500303,
					"content": "如果以摩拉來說，我想它應該是值不了多少的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500304,
					"content": "它的雕刻手法太粗糙，用的材料也是當地的普通石材…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500305,
					"content": "但對於那一代的「詠月使」，與如今的「霜月之子」來說，它價值千金。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500306,
					"content": "至少，在確定了這尊「月諭之像」的確存在後，我也能確定與之相關的一批文獻紀載的可靠性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500307,
					"content": "無論如何，總算沒有白跑一趟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500308,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙，{NICKNAME}。我果然沒看錯，這面「盈月之鏡」難不倒{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500309,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}操作機關的手法，已經讓這孩子佩服得五體投地了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500310,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500311,
					"content": "菈烏瑪，牠在說什麼啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500312,
					"content": "#牠說，{NICKNAME}拿寶物的手段是牠看過最強的，牠願意從此跟隨{NICKNAME}，打開世界上所有的寶箱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500313,
						766500314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500313,
					"content": "怎麼把我講得像小偷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500315,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "盜寶鼬"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500316,
					"content": "「以後有什麼打不開的寶箱，我會來請您幫忙的！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500317,
					"content": "走、走掉了…完全不給我們反駁的機會！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500318,
					"content": "#放心吧。牠不會每天叼著摩拉來敲{F#妳}{M#你}們的窗戶，拉著{F#妳}{M#你}們去尋找寶箱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500319,
					"content": "#也不會半夜來{F#妳}{M#你}屋子裡，嘴裡碎唸著那些自己打不開的鎖…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500320,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}！今天我們休息的時候，一定要鎖好門窗啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500321,
					"content": "放心吧，那孩子沒有惡意。只不過…話稍微多了一點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500322,
					"content": "好啦，我們一起回去吧，馬上就是晚餐時間了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500323,
					"content": "對了，還要思考一下，怎麼把這尊雕像運回書庫裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500324,
					"content": "…看起來，還是需要請幾位和我熟識的朋友來幫幫忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500314,
					"content": "雖然我的確打開了不少寶箱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500315
					]
				}
			]
