					"content": "還有什麼事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500409,
					"content": "#抱歉，這麼說可能有點突然。但我看兩位平日裡交遊頗廣，也聽說，{F#妳}{M#你}們曾踏足過許多隱密之地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500410,
					"content": "若是今後，兩位找到了有關「霜月之子」的典籍，我想要借看一下，再抄錄一份，用以充實書庫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500411,
						766500412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500411,
					"content": "沒問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500413,
					"content": "#我代表「霜月之子」，向{F#妳}{M#你}們再次致謝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500414,
						766500415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500414,
					"content": "那我繼續吃果子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500416,
					"content": "呼啊…這些果子真好吃，和我們平常吃到的口感完全不一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500417,
					"content": "呵呵，牠們久居林中，當然比一般人更能知道哪裡的果子最好吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500418,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "海崖鸚"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500419,
					"content": "#噗…這孩子說，{F#妳}{M#你}們儘管吃，牠是整個林子裡最會找果子的鳥，現在就去再找點果子過來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈烏瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500420,
					"content": "好吃，拜託你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						766500421
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 766500421,
					"content": "好吃，拜託你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 766500415,
					"content": "我桌上的果子呢？",
